{"4114690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ZuOnline", "steam_appid": 4114690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the legendary world of <strong>Zu Online</strong>, a reimagined martial arts MMORPG set in a realm of immortals, demons, and ancient Chinese mythology.<br>Originally beloved by fans of classic fantasy MMOs, <i>Zu Online</i> has been revived and modernized - rebuilt for today’s players with updated visuals, smoother performance, and rebalanced gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path as a Sun Warrior, Moonmaiden, Swordsman, Bead Fairy or Summoner, in the world ruled by 3 factions: Tai, Wu and Xun. <br>Master powerful spiritual arts, soar across floating mountains, and battle in massive PvP and cooperative raids. Whether you seek glory, peace, or enlightenment, the world of Zu awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Vast open world inspired by Chinese mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Real-time combat with unique class abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙‍♂️ Deep cultivation and skill progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕊️ PvE dungeons, world bosses, and faction wars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 Play solo or join guilds to shape the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛕 Rebalanced gameplay and reworked economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Classic MMO soul - reborn for the modern era</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is currently in Beta state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the legendary world of <strong>Zu Online</strong>, a reimagined martial arts MMORPG set in a realm of immortals, demons, and ancient Chinese mythology.<br>Originally beloved by fans of classic fantasy MMOs, <i>Zu Online</i> has been revived and modernized - rebuil